'''Low Mana''' is a condition that applies when the player's [[mana|mana pool]] falls below 50%. However, it does not apply if the maximum mana is set to 0 due to [[Blood Magic]].<ref name=Daniellowmana/>
==Related Items==
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=
  item_stats.id LIKE "%low_mana%"
  OR item_stats.id LIKE "%low_life_or_mana%"
|large=1
|stat=1
|level=1
}}

* {{il|Esh's Visage}} also had a conditional mod that related to Low Mana, but after a rework, the item no longer has mod related.

